        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sc5" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e8e3d6;strokeColor=#8a7f6a;html=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="506" y="746" width="138" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sc6" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#e8e3d6;strokeColor=#8a7f6a;html=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="506" y="766" width="138" height="18" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="stbundle" value="10. bundle, one per container&#10;written before the shim starts&#10;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;config.json&lt;/font&gt;&#10;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;rootfs/&lt;/font&gt;&#10;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;bootstrap.json&lt;/font&gt;" style="shape=note;size=14;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#8a7f6a;fontSize=14;html=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="902" y="576" width="254" height="170" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="cap" value="Figure 1. containerd, from an image reference to a running container. (1) The daemon reads its config, registers every subsystem as a plugin and initialises them in the order their Requires declare. (2) A client dials the daemon socket. (3) It resolves the reference and (4) fetches the layer blobs: the registry is talked to by the client, not by the daemon. (5) Blobs land in the content store, (6) the differ applies each layer and the snapshotter commits it, so two containers made from one image share the same committed layers and add only one writable snapshot each, and (7) the container record and its lease go into the bolt graph that the collector walks. (8) The task service execs a shim binary and hands it the bundle over ttrpc. (9) The shim, not the daemon, forks runc, so the container process is a child of the shim. (10) After a daemon restart the shim is still running and is re-attached from bootstrap.json. Commit not determined: this checkout carries no .git directory; version/version.go reports 2.4.0-beta+unknown." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#5f6368;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="874" width="1160" height="92" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="lgbg" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#fbfbfa;strokeColor=#b8b2a4;html=1;fontFamily=Times New Roman;" vertex="1" parent="legend">
          <mxGeometry x="0" y="0" width="250" height="310" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
